{"page":504,"blocks":[{"x":0.04849,"y":0.05257,"w":0.29299,"h":0.01535,"fs":0.01535,"n":2,"k":1,"t":"490 Chapter 8: Techniques of Integration"},{"x":0.32332,"y":0.09335,"w":0.21425,"h":0.01347,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":0,"t":"With n = 1 and a = 1, we have"},{"x":0.58853,"y":0.11431,"w":0.15588,"h":0.03531,"fs":0.01279,"n":3,"k":0,"t":"2 sin-1 x - 1 2L x2 dx"},{"x":0.48797,"y":0.11738,"w":0.11125,"h":0.02141,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":0,"t":"x sin-1 x dx = x2"},{"x":0.69826,"y":0.126,"w":0.06701,"h":0.02364,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":0,"t":"21 - x2."},{"x":0.32332,"y":0.1567,"w":0.36926,"h":0.01279,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"Next we use Formula 49 to find the integral on the right:"},{"x":0.4547,"y":0.17375,"w":0.22638,"h":0.03854,"fs":0.01279,"n":3,"k":0,"t":"2a2 - x2 dx = a2 2 sin-1 ax ab - 1"},{"x":0.48071,"y":0.18005,"w":0.0132,"h":0.01419,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"x2"},{"x":0.67289,"y":0.18351,"w":0.12737,"h":0.02515,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":0,"t":"2 x2a2 - x2 + C."},{"x":0.32333,"y":0.21868,"w":0.08174,"h":0.01347,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"With a = 1,"},{"x":0.49741,"y":0.23964,"w":0.0327,"h":0.01727,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"x2 dx"},{"x":0.48395,"y":0.2443,"w":0.28706,"h":0.03068,"fs":0.01279,"n":3,"k":0,"t":"21 - x2 = 1 2 sin-1 x - 1 2 x21 - x2 + C."},{"x":0.32332,"y":0.28203,"w":0.14949,"h":0.01279,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"The combined result is"},{"x":0.51991,"y":0.30356,"w":0.31115,"h":0.03044,"fs":0.01279,"n":4,"k":0,"t":"2 sin-1 x - 1 2 a1 2 sin-1 x - 1 2 x21 - x2 + Cb"},{"x":0.42134,"y":0.30538,"w":0.10926,"h":0.02141,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":0,"t":"x sin-1 xdx = x2"},{"x":0.50033,"y":0.34321,"w":0.04079,"h":0.02255,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"= ax2"},{"x":0.53043,"y":0.34321,"w":0.24841,"h":0.03044,"fs":0.01279,"n":3,"k":0,"t":"2 - 1 4bsin-1 x + 1 4 x21 - x2 + C′."},{"x":0.32332,"y":0.40189,"w":0.1539,"h":0.01375,"fs":0.01375,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"Reduction Formulas"},{"x":0.32332,"y":0.42654,"w":0.58898,"h":0.02814,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"k":1,"t":"The time required for repeated integrations by parts can sometimes be shortened by apply- ing reduction formulas like"},{"x":0.48128,"y":0.46683,"w":0.19436,"h":0.02703,"fs":0.01279,"n":3,"k":0,"t":"tann x dx = 1 n - 1 tann-1 x -"},{"x":0.70064,"y":0.46937,"w":0.2116,"h":0.01728,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"k":1,"t":"tann-2 x dx (1)"},{"x":0.4981,"y":0.50835,"w":0.16442,"h":0.01795,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"(ln x)n dx = x(ln x)n - n"},{"x":0.68015,"y":0.50902,"w":0.2321,"h":0.01728,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"k":1,"t":"(ln x)n-1 dx (2)"},{"x":0.35231,"y":0.54147,"w":0.24577,"h":0.02448,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":0,"t":"sinn x cosm x dx = -sinn-1 x cosm+1 x"},{"x":0.521,"y":0.54536,"w":0.14411,"h":0.02704,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"k":0,"t":"m + n + n - 1"},{"x":0.68465,"y":0.54866,"w":0.21812,"h":0.01728,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"k":1,"t":"sinn-2 x cosm x dx (n ≠-m)."},{"x":0.62256,"y":0.55894,"w":0.0604,"h":0.01783,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"m + nL"},{"x":0.89318,"y":0.57618,"w":0.01907,"h":0.01279,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"(3)"},{"x":0.32332,"y":0.5992,"w":0.5931,"h":0.02814,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"k":1,"t":"By applying such a formula repeatedly, we can eventually express the original integral in terms of a power low enough to be evaluated directly. The next example illustrates this procedure."},{"x":0.32332,"y":0.6512,"w":0.15172,"h":0.01449,"fs":0.01407,"n":2,"k":1,"t":"EXAMPLE 4 Find"},{"x":0.59646,"y":0.68039,"w":0.06032,"h":0.01728,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"tan5 x dx."},{"x":0.32333,"y":0.71856,"w":0.34409,"h":0.01365,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"k":1,"t":"Solution We apply Equation (1) with n = 5 to get"},{"x":0.51058,"y":0.74435,"w":0.08885,"h":0.01982,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":0,"t":"tan5 x dx = 1"},{"x":0.59124,"y":0.74689,"w":0.0894,"h":0.02811,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"k":0,"t":"4 tan4 x - L"},{"x":0.68234,"y":0.74689,"w":0.06032,"h":0.01728,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"tan3 x dx."},{"x":0.32332,"y":0.7814,"w":0.5351,"h":0.01347,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"We then apply Equation (1) again, with n = 3, to evaluate the remaining integral:"},{"x":0.66288,"y":0.80096,"w":0.17434,"h":0.03309,"fs":0.01353,"n":1,"k":0,"t":"2 tan2 x + ln 0 cos x0 + C."},{"x":0.41602,"y":0.80702,"w":0.08885,"h":0.01982,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":0,"t":"tan3 x dx = 1"},{"x":0.58777,"y":0.80702,"w":0.0833,"h":0.01982,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":0,"t":"tan x dx = 1"},{"x":0.49668,"y":0.80956,"w":0.0894,"h":0.02811,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"k":0,"t":"2 tan2 x - L"},{"x":0.32333,"y":0.84475,"w":0.14949,"h":0.01279,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"The combined result is"},{"x":0.5403,"y":0.86362,"w":0.25331,"h":0.03309,"fs":0.01353,"n":2,"k":0,"t":"4 tan4 x - 1 2 tan2 x - ln 0 cos x0 + C′."},{"x":0.45964,"y":0.86968,"w":0.08885,"h":0.01982,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":0,"t":"tan5 x dx = 1"},{"x":0.32332,"y":0.90741,"w":0.59294,"h":0.02814,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"k":1,"t":"As their form suggests, reduction formulas are derived using integration by parts. (See Example 5 in Section 8.2.)"}]}